Nabla_Text_WallyWaitForMe:
	.string "WALLY: {PLAYER}{KUN}! Wait for me!$"

Nabla_Text_WallyMagmaWentToTheForest:
	.string "WALLY: Huff… huff… I finally\n"
	.string "caught up with you!\p"
	.string "On my way here, I saw TEAM MAGMA\n"
	.string "go south of ROUTE 123, into the\l"
	.string "EMERALD FOREST.\p"
	.string "I heard them talking… They're\n"
	.string "looking for a POKéMON that can\l"
	.string "travel through time!\p"
	.string "They want to go back in time and\n"
	.string "get the ORB they're missing!\p"
	.string "We can't let them do that!\n"
	.string "I'll wait for you at the entrance\l"
	.string "of the forest. Hurry!$"

Nabla_Text_JaggedPassGuard:
	.string "Our leader MAXIE is away in the\n"
	.string "EMERALD FOREST, south of ROUTE 123.\p"
	.string "Nobody gets into our hideout\n"
	.string "until he's back!$"

Nabla_Text_WallyForestEntrance:
	.string "WALLY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, you came!\p"
	.string "TEAM MAGMA went deep into the\n"
	.string "forest. Their leader is with them.\p"
	.string "There are grunts everywhere…\n"
	.string "I'll sneak around them and find\l"
	.string "where their leader went.\p"
	.string "Meet me in the heart of the forest!$"

Nabla_Text_ForestGrunt1Intro:
	.string "Hey! This forest is off-limits!\n"
	.string "TEAM MAGMA has business here!$"

Nabla_Text_ForestGrunt1Defeat:
	.string "Ugh… You're tough.$"

Nabla_Text_ForestGrunt1PostBattle:
	.string "Our leader is looking for a POKéMON\n"
	.string "that travels through time.\p"
	.string "With it, we'll get that ORB back!$"

Nabla_Text_ForestGrunt2Intro:
	.string "You're not getting any closer\n"
	.string "to our leader!$"

Nabla_Text_ForestGrunt2Defeat:
	.string "No way…$"

Nabla_Text_ForestGrunt2PostBattle:
	.string "They say a POKéMON protects this\n"
	.string "forest… It's not just a legend!$"

Nabla_Text_ForestGrunt3Intro:
	.string "The heart of the forest is just\n"
	.string "ahead. Nobody else goes in!$"

Nabla_Text_ForestGrunt3Defeat:
	.string "Our leader won't be happy…$"

Nabla_Text_ForestGrunt3PostBattle:
	.string "Go on, then…\n"
	.string "MAXIE will deal with you himself.$"

Nabla_Text_WallyThereTheyAre:
	.string "WALLY: {PLAYER}{KUN}! Over here…\p"
	.string "Look, by that old tree.\n"
	.string "It's their leader!$"

Nabla_Text_MaxieForestIntro:
	.string "MAXIE: …So, the TRAINER from\n"
	.string "MT. CHIMNEY followed us here.\p"
	.string "This old tree is the home of the\n"
	.string "guardian of this forest. A POKéMON\l"
	.string "that crosses time itself.\p"
	.string "With its power, we will go back to\n"
	.string "the moment TEAM AQUA took the ORB,\l"
	.string "and take it first.\p"
	.string "TABITHA! These children will not\n"
	.string "stand in our way!$"

Nabla_Text_WallyLetsBattleTogether:
	.string "WALLY: {PLAYER}{KUN}, let's battle them\n"
	.string "together!$"

Nabla_Text_WallyChooseYourPokemon:
	.string "WALLY: Choose three POKéMON\n"
	.string "for this battle!$"

Nabla_Text_MaxieForestDefeat:
	.string "MAXIE: Hmph… You two are stronger\n"
	.string "than I expected.$"

Nabla_Text_TabithaForestDefeat:
	.string "TABITHA: Aaargh! Sorry, leader!$"

Nabla_Text_MaxieThisIsNotOver:
	.string "MAXIE: This isn't over…\n"
	.string "The guardian of time will be ours!$"

Nabla_Text_MaxieItsCelebi:
	.string "MAXIE: That light… It came out of\n"
	.string "the old tree!\p"
	.string "CELEBI! At last!$"

Nabla_Text_CelebiLooksAtWally:
	.string "CELEBI is looking at WALLY…$"

Nabla_Text_MaxieRetreats:
	.string "MAXIE: It… chose that boy?\p"
	.string "…Very well. If time will not help us,\n"
	.string "we will awaken GROUDON with what\l"
	.string "we have.\p"
	.string "TABITHA! We're leaving!$"

Nabla_Text_WallyCelebiComeWithMe:
	.string "WALLY: CELEBI…\n"
	.string "Do you want to come with me?$"

Nabla_Text_CelebiChoseWally:
	.string "CELEBI chose WALLY as its TRAINER!$"

Nabla_Text_WallyLetsBattle:
	.string "WALLY: Thank you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
	.string "I'd never have made it without you.\p"
	.string "I want to see how strong we are,\n"
	.string "CELEBI and I!\p"
	.string "Let me heal your POKéMON first.\n"
	.string "Then… battle me, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$"

Nabla_Text_WallyReadyAgain:
	.string "WALLY: {PLAYER}{KUN}! Ready to try again?\n"
	.string "Let me heal your POKéMON first.$"

Nabla_Text_WallyForestDefeat:
	.string "WALLY: …I lost. You're still so far\n"
	.string "ahead of me, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$"

Nabla_Text_WallyFarewell:
	.string "WALLY: CELEBI and I will keep\n"
	.string "getting stronger.\p"
	.string "The next time we battle,\n"
	.string "we'll win for sure!\p"
	.string "See you, {PLAYER}{KUN}!$"
